STATEMENT: >>>
Cohost a JSON-RPC 2.0 Unix-socket adapter with the existing HTTP server, add a small CLI client for discovery, workspace description, snapshot retrieval and explicit reload, and verify workspace isolation, socket permissions, error behavior and shared generation state across both transports.
<<<
